`_ReviewSpecTable` is a surface card with a header row showing both car names, then rows for Price, Year, Mileage, Fuel, Transmission and Body. Label column is 104 wide, values are `Expanded`. Missing values render `N/A`.

## 14.4 Cross navigation

"View Full Comparison" pushes `CompareDetailsScreen(review.carA, review.carB)`. The article and the specification table must always describe the same two cars.

# 15. ALL EXPERT REVIEWS SCREEN

`AllReviewsScreen` — the full list behind "Read all expert reviews".

- App bar title "All Expert Reviews" with a back arrow.
- A count line: "1 review" or "N reviews".
- Rows use the shared `ReviewListTile` (96x92 cover of car A, title, author and date, summary).
- Pagination: `pageSize = 5`; "Load More Reviews" adds five rows at a time.
